  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula to calculate the elongation of a metallic wire because of the application of a load can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right left right left right left right left right left right left\" columnspacing=\"0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The ratio of the elongations for both the wires is, then, calculated as follows-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi></mstyle><mn>1</mn></msub></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mpadded voffset=\"+2px\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mpadded></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>"
